# Log: Create Minimalist Zen / Editorial Design Variant (variant-4-zen.html)

## Step 1: Create variant-4-zen.html
- Created complete single HTML file with Minimalist Zen / Editorial design
- All CSS and JS inline, Google Fonts CDN for Playfair Display + Source Sans 3

### Color palette implemented:
- Light mode: bg #FAFAF9, accent sage #6B8F71, secondary dusty rose #C2A0A0, text charcoal #292524, borders #D6D3D1
- Dark mode: bg #1C1917, text #E7E5E4, accent lighter sage #8FB896, borders #44403C

### Typography:
- Playfair Display for all headings (serif, editorial feel)
- Source Sans 3 for body text (clean, readable)
- line-height 1.8 for body, 1.9 for long-form text
- Italic accents on key heading words using <em> tags
- Generous spacing throughout

### Design decisions:
- NO card backgrounds anywhere — content flows with thin 1px dividers
- NO shadows anywhere
- NO rounded corners (square photo with accent-colored frame offset)
- 160px section padding
- Decorative serif ornament dividers between sections (thin lines + diamond character)
- Photo: large 220px square with 1px sage accent frame offset (8px offset)
- Stats: displayed inline as elegant text ("25+ лет опыта · 7+ лет репетиторства · 1-9 классы · 2x призёр · 4+ страны")
- FAQ: serif bold questions with answers below, separated by thin lines only
- Narrow 800px max-width for text sections (editorial feel)
- Wider 1100px for about section with photo layout
- Form inputs: bottom-border-only style (no boxes)
- Buttons: thin outline style, fills with sage green on hover (0.5s transition)

### Animations:
- Very subtle: opacity fade-in + minimal 10px translateY
- 1s duration with ease timing
- Hover: color change only on links/buttons (no transform effects)
- Counter: smooth count-up animation on stat numbers
- FAQ accordion with smooth max-height transition

### Sections preserved (all Russian text identical to index.html):
- Header (sticky, ultra-minimal, serif logo, thin nav)
- Hero (centered, extreme whitespace, thin line separator, outline CTA)
- Кому подойдёт (audience list with thin dividers)
- Результаты в цифрах (inline text stats)
- О преподавателе (two-column with square photo + offset frame)
- Как проходят занятия (numbered steps with serif numbers)
- Методика (2-column grid with thin borders)
- Формат занятий (centered block with dividers)
- Виды занятий (3-column grid with thin borders)
- Цены (centered block with dividers)
- Отзывы (serif italic quotes)
- FAQ (serif questions, accordion)
- Форма записи (bottom-border inputs)
- Контакты (centered, minimal)
- Footer (dark charcoal)

### Functionality preserved:
- Dark mode toggle with localStorage persistence (separate key 'theme-preference-zen')
- System preference detection
- Mobile responsive with hamburger menu
- Scroll reveal animations (IntersectionObserver)
- Counter animation on stats section
- FAQ accordion (one-at-a-time)
- Form validation with submit handler
- Background images on 3 sections only (about, method, faq) at very low opacity (0.035)

### Responsive breakpoints:
- 1024px: narrower about layout
- 768px: single-column about, single-column methods, 2-column types, hamburger nav, 100px section padding
- 480px: single-column types, 80px section padding

